===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|tyme}}, {{m|enm|time}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tīma|t=time, period, space of time, season, lifetime, fixed time, favorable time, opportunity}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*tīmō}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*tīmô|t=time}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*deh₂imō}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*deh₂y-|t=to divide}}. Related to {{m|en|tide}}. Not related directly to {{noncog|la|tempus}}.
